&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:31.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;(b) 受注実績&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:40.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;当連結会計年度における受注実績は、次のとおりであります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_unitR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:0pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:468.3pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
